"""
Job Portal Management System (Single-file Tkinter + SQLite3)
Features implemented (approx):
1. User Registration & Login System (Job Seeker / Employer)
2. Admin Dashboard (manage users, jobs, feedbacks)
3. Profile Management
4. Job Posting Module
5. Job Search & Filter
6. Job Application System
7. Resume Upload (stores path)
8. View Applied Jobs
9. Notification (simple matching alerts)
10. SQLite3 DB backend
11. Attractive-ish Tkinter GUI using ttk
12. Data validation & error handling
"""

